## AbortController 请求取消

`AbortController` 提供了取消 Fetch 请求的能力，适用于组件卸载、超时控制、搜索防抖等场景。

```typescript
function fetchWithTimeout<T>(url: string, timeoutMs: number): Promise<T> {
  const controller = new AbortController();
  const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), timeoutMs);

  return fetch(url, { signal: controller.signal })
    .then((response) => {
      clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);
      return response.json() as Promise<T>;
    })
    .catch((error) => {
      clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      if (error.name === 'AbortError') {
        throw new Error(`Request timed out after ${timeoutMs}ms`);
      }
      throw error;
    });
}

class SearchController {
  private currentController: AbortController | null = null;

  async search(query: string): Promise<string[]> {
    this.currentController?.abort();
    this.currentController = new AbortController();

    const response = await fetch(`/api/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`, {
      signal: this.currentController.signal,
    });

    return response.json();
  }

  cancel(): void {
    this.currentController?.abort();
    this.currentController = null;
  }
}
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as 应用
    participant AC as AbortController
    participant Fetch as Fetch API
    participant Server as 服务器

    App->>AC: new AbortController()
    App->>Fetch: fetch(url, { signal })
    Fetch->>Server: HTTP 请求
    App->>AC: abort()
    AC->>Fetch: AbortSignal triggered
    Fetch-->>App: AbortError
    Server-->>Fetch: 响应（被忽略）
```

